asset:        footage.aep
title:        After Effects footage item prototypes for the exporter
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
added:        2026-10-18 by vangel76
notes:        Footage items (png, jpeg, OpenEXR, TIFF, Targa, Photoshop, Illustrator and EPS stills, an H.264 mp4, a ProRes mov, a WAV, png, OpenEXR and jpeg sequences, each with its f-records) extracted by crates/aep-export/examples/mkftprotos from the contributor's own synthetic cases 351, 353, 603-607, 611-613 and 650-653 (generated with Adobe After Effects 2026; the media were rendered by EffectCraft or generated by the contributor); the alias JSON of every item replaced by a neutral one, so the file holds no path or machine name; synthetic structure only, no third-party content or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used.
